  "author": "Damien Benveniste",
  "siteName": "The AiEdge Newsletter",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"post-header\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Post header\">\n   <h3 class=\"subtitle subtitle-HEEcLo\" dir=\"auto\">Follow reconstruction training into parallel predictions, successive commitments, and the work behind faster generation.</h3>\n   <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-paddingBottom-16 pc-reset\" aria-label=\"Post UFI\" role=\"region\">\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-paddingY-16 pc-justifyContent-space-between pc-alignItems-center pc-reset\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-12 pc-alignItems-center pc-reset byline-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-reset\">\n       <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-row pc-gap-8 pc-alignItems-center pc-justifyContent-flex-start pc-reset\">\n        <div style=\"--scale:36px;--offset:9px;--border-width:4.5px\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-row pc-alignItems-center pc-justifyContent-flex-start pc-reset ltr-qDBmby\">\n         <a href=\"https://substack.com/@damienbenveniste\" aria-label=\"View Damien Benveniste's profile\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset\"> \n          <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-36 pc-height-36 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-zsvint flex-auto-Ui4XB2 animate-o2cZpX outline-detail-MZomZU pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-aKGHtM sizing-border-box-tYLTRQ pressable-sm-lfVyam showFocus-WVN5uq container-TAtrWj interactive-UkK0V6 avatar-u8q6xB last-JfNEJ_\" style=\"--scale:36px\" tabindex=\"0\">\n           <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-36 pc-height-36 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-zsvint flex-auto-Ui4XB2 outline-detail-MZomZU pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-aKGHtM sizing-border-box-tYLTRQ container-TAtrWj\" style=\"--scale:36px\" title=\"Damien Benveniste\">\n            <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124053650_2157884e-8c5d-4cde-ab33-455fa623975d_2060x2061.jpeg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124053650_2157884e-8c5d-4cde-ab33-455fa623975d_2060x2061.jpeg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124053650_2157884e-8c5d-4cde-ab33-455fa623975d_2060x2061.jpeg 3x\"><img class=\"img-X9O5To object-fit-cover-cB3K0O pencraft pc-reset\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124053650_2157884e-8c5d-4cde-ab33-455fa623975d_2060x2061.jpeg\" alt=\"Damien Benveniste's avatar\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124053650_2157884e-8c5d-4cde-ab33-455fa623975d_2060x2061.jpeg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124053650_2157884e-8c5d-4cde-ab33-455fa623975d_2060x2061.jpeg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124053650_2157884e-8c5d-4cde-ab33-455fa623975d_2060x2061.jpeg 3x\" draggable=\"false\"></picture>\n           </div>\n          </div> \n         </a>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset\">\n       <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-primary-cPcl_r line-height-20-DxeVem font-meta-mBdcth size-11-Pn75Jw weight-medium-W9KlJB transform-uppercase-m8PhL1 reset-KrJVVF meta-jfcJ27\">\n        <span style=\"min-width:0\" id=\"base-ui-_R_1lcn328smd5alip_\"><a class=\"pencraft pc-reset decoration-hover-underline-wbvMef reset-KrJVVF\" href=\"https://substack.com/@damienbenveniste\">Damien Benveniste</a></span>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-4 pc-reset\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-Y_KLZk line-height-20-DxeVem font-meta-mBdcth size-11-Pn75Jw weight-medium-W9KlJB transform-uppercase-m8PhL1 reset-KrJVVF meta-jfcJ27\">\n         <time datetime=\"2026-11-27T16:02:40.684Z\" title=\"2026-11-27T16:02:40.684Z\">Nov 27, 2026</time>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-Y_KLZk line-height-20-DxeVem font-meta-mBdcth size-11-Pn75Jw weight-medium-W9KlJB transform-uppercase-m8PhL1 reset-KrJVVF meta-jfcJ27\">\n         ∙ <!-- -->\n          Paid\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-16 pc-justifyContent-space-between pc-alignItems-center pc-reset flex-grow-zFd_bz post-ufi\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n      <div class=\"like-button-container post-ufi-button style-button\">\n       <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button no-label with-border\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Like\" aria-pressed=\"false\"></button>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button post-ufi-comment-button no-label with-border\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"View comments (0)\" data-href=\"https://newsletter.theaiedge.io/p/how-masked-diffusion-llms-generate-text/comments\"></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button no-label with-border\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" id=\"base-ui-_R_ecv328smd5alip_\"></button>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n      <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button has-label with-border\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"> \n       <div class=\"label\">Share</div> \n      </button>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"dt-post-body\">\n    <div class=\"available-content\">\n     <div class=\"body markup\" dir=\"auto\">\n      <p><span>A </span><strong>masked diffusion LLM</strong><span> generates text by repeatedly filling missing token positions. It starts with a prompt and a set of empty output slots represented by a special mask token. A neural network predicts what could belong in those slots; a sampling procedure reveals some predictions and runs the network again with the updated text. Ordinary next-token generation instead extends a completed prefix one token at a time.</span></p>\n      <p><span>In a recent </span><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/LocalLLaMA/comments/1xa6ykz/has_anyone_else_here_found_a_place_for/\">practitioner discussion</a><span>, users describe diffusion models as useful for rapid prompt variation while reporting mixed quality and speed, making useful output per generation pass a practical concern.</span></p>\n      <p>How can predicting several missing positions at once produce coherent text?</p>\n      <p><strong>The model learns to predict from incomplete context, and successive passes make that context more complete.</strong><span> The sampler controls how much information becomes visible before the next decisions. That control connects the training objective to both generation quality and execution cost.</span></p>\n      <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n       <figure>\n        <a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127162313_4582214e-fddb-4847-9ca2-fbc0a4da8056_1920x819.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"> \n         <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n          <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127162313_4582214e-fddb-4847-9ca2-fbc0a4da8056_1920x819.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127162313_4582214e-fddb-4847-9ca2-fbc0a4da8056_1920x819.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127162313_4582214e-fddb-4847-9ca2-fbc0a4da8056_1920x819.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127162313_4582214e-fddb-4847-9ca2-fbc0a4da8056_1920x819.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127162313_4582214e-fddb-4847-9ca2-fbc0a4da8056_1920x819.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4582214e-fddb-4847-9ca2-fbc0a4da8056_1920x819.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:819,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1215963,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Causal generation appends a token to a prefix; masked diffusion can reveal separated positions while leaving other slots masked.&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Causal generation appends a token to a prefix; masked diffusion can reveal separated positions while leaving other slots masked.\" title=\"Causal generation appends a token to a prefix; masked diffusion can reveal separated positions while leaving other slots masked.\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127162313_4582214e-fddb-4847-9ca2-fbc0a4da8056_1920x819.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127162313_4582214e-fddb-4847-9ca2-fbc0a4da8056_1920x819.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127162313_4582214e-fddb-4847-9ca2-fbc0a4da8056_1920x819.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261127162313_4582214e-fddb-4847-9ca2-fbc0a4da8056_1920x819.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture>\n          <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n           <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n            <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"> \n             <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\">\n              <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n             </svg> \n            </button>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n         </div> \n        </a>\n        <figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Both methods need later computation, but they expose different text to that computation.</figcaption>\n       </figure>\n      </div>\n      <p><span>There is one distinction to keep in mind throughout: </span><strong>a prediction is not yet a committed token</strong><span>. A pass can propose words for every remaining mask while keeping only two. The other proposals disappear. On the next pass, those positions receive fresh predictions conditioned on the two newly visible words.</span></p>\n      <p>Two predictions made in the same pass share the same input, but neither gets to read the other's sampled token. That information becomes available only after the sampler writes the tokens into the next input. Parallel prediction is useful; deciding how much to commit together is a separate problem.</p>\n      <p>We will connect reconstruction training, reveal probabilities, an eight-position generation trace, and the actual sampler operations. Then we can account for what fewer passes save and what they repeat.</p>\n      <p><strong>Contents</strong></p>\n      <ul>\n       <li>\n        <p>Learn from missing tokens</p>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <p>Turn predictions into a generation step</p>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <p>Follow eight positions through four passes</p>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <p>Why simultaneous choices can disagree</p>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <p>Read the sampler's state updates</p>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <p>Count the work behind the speed</p>\n       </li>\n      </ul>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"paywall\" data-testid=\"paywall\" data-component-name=\"Paywall\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Paywall\">\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-64 pc-height-64 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-zsvint flex-auto-Ui4XB2 outline-detail-MZomZU pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-aKGHtM sizing-border-box-tYLTRQ container-TAtrWj paywall-unlock-avatar\" style=\"--scale:64px\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-64 pc-height-64 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-zsvint flex-auto-Ui4XB2 outline-detail-MZomZU pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-aKGHtM sizing-border-box-tYLTRQ container-TAtrWj\" style=\"--scale:64px\" title=\"User\">\n      <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124053650_2157884e-8c5d-4cde-ab33-455fa623975d_2060x2061.jpeg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124053650_2157884e-8c5d-4cde-ab33-455fa623975d_2060x2061.jpeg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124053650_2157884e-8c5d-4cde-ab33-455fa623975d_2060x2061.jpeg 3x\"><img class=\"img-X9O5To object-fit-cover-cB3K0O pencraft pc-reset\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124053650_2157884e-8c5d-4cde-ab33-455fa623975d_2060x2061.jpeg\" alt=\"User's avatar\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124053650_2157884e-8c5d-4cde-ab33-455fa623975d_2060x2061.jpeg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124053650_2157884e-8c5d-4cde-ab33-455fa623975d_2060x2061.jpeg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261124053650_2157884e-8c5d-4cde-ab33-455fa623975d_2060x2061.jpeg 3x\" draggable=\"false\"></picture>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <h2 class=\"paywall-title unlock-treatment-new\">Continue reading this post for free, courtesy of Damien Benveniste.</h2>\n    <div class=\"paywall-cta\">\n     <a data-native=\"true\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft subscribe-btn subscribeButton-LcKYi7 paywall-cta-icon buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\">Claim my free post</button></a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"paywall-secondary-cta\">\n     <a href=\"https://newsletter.theaiedge.io/subscribe?simple=true&amp;next=https%3A%2F%2Fnewsletter.theaiedge.io%2Fp%2Fhow-masked-diffusion-llms-generate-text&amp;utm_source=paywall&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;utm_content=226737517&amp;just_signed_up=falsesimple=true&amp;utm_source=paywall&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=226737517&amp;next=https://newsletter.theaiedge.io/p/how-masked-diffusion-llms-generate-text\" data-native=\"true\">Or purchase a paid subscription.</a>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\">\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-paddingY-16 pc-justifyContent-flex-start pc-reset\">\n     <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft buttonBase-tqxFUX buttonText-iyo5dl buttonStyle-mAh5l3 priority_secondary-AkqbVJ size_md-LAJe4y\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"> \n      <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left\">\n       <path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path>\n      </svg>Previous \n     </button>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "本文介绍掩码扩散 LLM 如何通过并行预测和逐步确定结果，迭代填充掩码位置来生成文本，并将其与传统的下一个词元生成方式进行对比。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "本文介绍掩码扩散 LLM 如何通过并行预测和逐步确定结果，迭代填充掩码位置来生成文本，并将其与传统的下一个词元生成方式进行对比。",
  "summary": "本文介绍掩码扩散 LLM：它们通过反复填充由掩码 token 表示的缺失位置来生成文本。与传统的下一个 token 生成方式逐个扩展前缀不同，掩码扩散模型会并行预测多个位置，同时让其他位置保持掩码状态。模型学会根据不完整的上下文进行预测，再通过连续多轮处理逐步补全上下文。采样器控制下一轮决策前有多少信息变为可见，从而将训练目标与生成质量、执行成本联系起来。文章以一个包含 8 个位置、经过 4 轮处理的生成过程为例，说明并行预测如何共享同一输入，以及如何通过采样按顺序确定结果，并分析减少处理轮次与重复计算之间的权衡。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "掩码扩散 LLM 通过迭代填充掩码 token 位置来生成文本，而不是依次扩展前缀。",
      "explanation": "模型从提示词和由掩码 token 表示的空输出位置开始，预测这些位置可能包含的内容，再由采样过程揭示部分预测结果，供下一轮处理使用。这与因果式下一个 token 生成不同，后者每次只在已完成的前缀后添加一个 token。"
    },
    {
      "point": "同一轮中的并行预测共享相同输入，但不会读取彼此采样得到的 token。",
      "explanation": "虽然模型可以同时预测多个位置，但只有当采样器将采样得到的 token 写入下一轮输入后，这些信息才会变得可用。因此，同一轮中作出的预测无法以彼此最终确定的结果为条件。"
    },
    {
      "point": "采样器控制下一轮决策前有多少信息变为可见，从而关联训练目标与质量、成本之间的权衡。",
      "explanation": "这种控制机制决定每轮有多少预测结果会被确定，进而影响生成文本的连贯性和生成过程的计算效率。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "掩码扩散 LLM 通过反复填充缺失的 token 位置来生成文本。",
    "预测结果还不等于已确定的 token——一轮处理中可以为所有剩余掩码提出词语，但只确定其中两个。",
    "并行预测很有用；而决定一次要确定多少内容，则是另一个问题。"
  ],
